the NON-LEARNED JOINT heuristic as the coordination proxy; JOINT is **not an upper bound**
on a *trained* occupancy-conditioned coordination Q. A trained L2 arm could in principle
exceed the JOINT heuristic (though the deploy-bound finding + the SDD-04 NOT_CONVERGED /
