- Exact training-source digest + exact TLE-set digest + exact dependency versions + the original TRAIN-sampler factory establish an exact **environment implementation/distribution match** for a rollout bound to the archived tree. Fresh development seeds need not equal the training seed: they draw new scenarios from the same frozen TRAIN distribution rather than replaying the training trajectory.
