+| Authenticated MODQN | 100 | **0.04170** [0.03, 0.07] | **68.70** [56, 82] | **7.47** [4, 12] | **0.07470** [0.02, 0.13] | 0 [0, 0] |
+| Zero-learning myopic | 100 | **0.05010** [0.03, 0.12] | **63.32** [38, 79] | **6.47** [4, 12] | **0.13920** [0.03, 0.27] | 0 [0, 0] |
